{
 "esm": "1.3.0",
 "metadata": {
  "name": "cam_zm_templates",
  "description": "Expression-template library for the CAM6 ZM deep-convection chain (stage 2 of the EqESM project): the shared pointwise laws of buoyan_dilute, parcel_dilute, entropy and closure (components/cam/src/atmos_phys/schemes/zhang_mcfarlane/zm_convr.F90 of the instrumented cam6_4_212 fork), transcribed exactly for use by cam_zm_parcel.esm and cam_zm_closure.esm. The library carries (a) the saturation specific humidity of the ZM qsat_hPa wrapper (zm_convr.F90:2634-2649) and its qsat_water core (wv_sat_methods.F90:227-250): zm_qsat_hPa = svp_to_qsat(min(goff_gratch_water(t), p*100), p*100) with p in hPa and the x100 hPa-to-Pa factor declared 100 Pa/hPa (the qsat_hPa es output in hPa is dropped: no consumer reads it); (b) the moist static energies hmn = cp t + grav z + rl q and hsat = cp t + grav z + rl qst of cldprp (zm_convr.F90:1829-1830; the same law is the hmn_lev profile of the buoyan_dilute parcel_pbl branch, F90:979,1018); (c) the environmental and parcel virtual temperatures tv = t (1+1.608 q)/(1+q) (F90:1005-1006, 1088) and tpv = (tp + tpert) (1+1.608 qstp)/(1+qtot) with qtot the parcel total water new_q at the ascent levels (F90:1476) and qstp at the launch level (F90:1415); (d) the Raymond-Blyth moist entropy of entropy (F90:1489-1513) with pref = 1000 hPa and the vapor pressure e = qv p/(eps1 + qv); and (e) the closure per-level laws (F90:2318-2506): the virtual potential temperatures thetavp/thetavm above and below the LCL (F90:2457, 2462, 2474, 2480), d(qs)/dT of the parcel dqsdtp (F90:2458), the parcel temperature response dtpdt (F90:2460-2462), the heating/drying terms at the jt interface dtmdt/dqmdt (F90:2423-2428; beta = 0, F90:2433, collapses the ql weights to ql(k+1)) and in the interior (F90:2432-2446), and the CAPE-change integrands dboydt above and below the LCL (F90:2464-2468, 2482-2485). Constants are SHR_CONST_* values as passed at the zm_convr_run call site (cpres = 1004.64 J/(kg K), rl = 2.501e6 J/kg, rgas = 287.0423113650487 J/(kg K), eps1 = 0.6219705862045155, tfreez = 273.15 K, grav = 9.80616 m/s^2, cpliq = 4188 J/(kg K), cpwv = 1810 J/(kg K), rh2o = 461.5046398201599 J/(kg K)), bound at the application sites rather than hard-coded here. All thermodynamic inputs are in the ZM working units: pressures hPa, temperatures K, humidities kg/kg.",
  "license": "MIT",
  "tags": [
   "eqesm:stage2",
   "model:atmosphere",
   "physics:deep-convection"
  ],
  "references": [
   {
    "citation": "Zhang, G. J. and McFarlane, N. A. (1995). Sensitivity of climate simulations to the parameterization of cumulus convection in the Canadian Climate Centre general circulation model. Atmosphere-Ocean 33(3), 407-446."
   },
   {
    "citation": "Raymond, D. J. and Blyth, A. M. (1992). Extension of the stochastic mixing model to cumulonimbus clouds. J. Atmos. Sci. 49, 1968-1983."
   }
  ]
 },
 "expression_template_imports": [
  {
   "ref": "./cam_templates.esm"
  }
 ],
 "expression_templates": {
  "zm_qsat_hPa": {
   "description": "Saturation specific humidity of the ZM qsat_hPa wrapper (zm_convr.F90:2634-2649): qs = qsat_water(t, p*100) (wv_sat_methods.F90:227-250) = svp_to_qsat(min(goff_gratch_water(t), p_pa), p_pa) with p_pa = p x (100 Pa/hPa), p in hPa. Reuses goff_gratch_water and svp_to_qsat of cam_templates.esm by reference, so the ZM saturation law is bit-identical to the qsat of cam_wv_saturation.esm (which pins the same Goff-Gratch/svp_to_qsat pair to cam_qsat.csv). The qsat_hPa es output (hPa) is dropped: no consumer of this template reads it.",
   "params": [
    "t",
    "p"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "apply_expression_template",
    "args": [],
    "name": "svp_to_qsat",
    "bindings": {
     "es": {
      "op": "min",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "apply_expression_template",
        "args": [],
        "name": "goff_gratch_water",
        "bindings": {
         "t": "t"
        }
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "p",
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 100.0,
          "units": "Pa/hPa"
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     "p": {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "p",
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 100.0,
        "units": "Pa/hPa"
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   }
  },
  "zm_moist_static_energy": {
   "description": "Moist static energy hmn = cpres t + grav z + rl q of cldprp (zm_convr.F90:1829; the same law is hmn_lev of the buoyan_dilute parcel_pbl branch, F90:979, and the hmax search hmn of the default branch, F90:1018).",
   "params": [
    "t",
    "z",
    "q",
    "cpres",
    "grav",
    "rl"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "cpres",
       "t"
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "grav",
         "z"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "rl",
         "q"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_sat_moist_static_energy": {
   "description": "Saturated moist static energy hsat = cpres t + grav z + rl qst of cldprp (zm_convr.F90:1830) with qst = zm_qsat_hPa(t, p) the environment saturation specific humidity at the level.",
   "params": [
    "t",
    "z",
    "p",
    "cpres",
    "grav",
    "rl"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "cpres",
       "t"
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "grav",
         "z"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "rl",
         {
          "op": "apply_expression_template",
          "args": [],
          "name": "zm_qsat_hPa",
          "bindings": {
           "t": "t",
           "p": "p"
          }
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_env_virtual_temperature": {
   "description": "Environmental virtual temperature tv = t (1 + 1.608 q)/(1 + q) of buoyan_dilute (zm_convr.F90:1005-1006, the tv initialization, and 1088, the tv of the buoyancy loop).",
   "params": [
    "t",
    "q"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "/",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "t",
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 1.0,
          "units": "1"
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1.608,
            "units": "1"
           },
           "q"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       "q"
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_parcel_virtual_temperature": {
   "description": "Parcel virtual temperature tpv = (tp + tpert) (1 + 1.608 qstp)/(1 + qtot) of parcel_dilute (zm_convr.F90:1476, the ascent levels, where qtot = new_q, the parcel total water after rain-out; and 1415, the launch level, where qstp = q and qtot = qstp = q). qtot is a free parameter because new_q is an output of the ientropy solve that is not dumped (see the cam_zm_parcel.esm gap list); at the launch level the law collapses to qtot = qstp.",
   "params": [
    "tp",
    "tpert",
    "qstp",
    "qtot"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "/",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         "tp",
         "tpert"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 1.0,
          "units": "1"
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1.608,
            "units": "1"
           },
           "qstp"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       "qtot"
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_rb_entropy": {
   "description": "The Raymond-Blyth moist entropy of the ZM entropy function (zm_convr.F90:1489-1513): ent = (cpres + qtot cpliq) log(TK/tfreez) - rgas log((p - e)/pref) + L qv/TK - qv rh2o log(qv/qst), with L = rl - (cpliq - cpwv) (TK - tfreez), qst = zm_qsat_hPa(TK, p), qv = min(qtot, qst), e = qv p/(eps1 + qv) and pref = 1000 hPa (the function's parameter pref, F90:1499). The logarithms are taken of dimensionless ratios (TK/tfreez, (p - e)/pref, qv/qst) as required by the dimensional checker; the Fortran takes them of the dimensioned values.",
   "params": [
    "TK",
    "p",
    "qtot",
    "cpres",
    "rl",
    "rgas",
    "eps1",
    "tfreez",
    "cpliq",
    "cpwv",
    "rh2o"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "+",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         "cpres",
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "qtot",
           "cpliq"
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "log",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           "TK",
           "tfreez"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.0,
          "units": "J/(kg*K)"
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           "rgas",
           {
            "op": "log",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "-",
                "args": [
                 "p",
                 {
                  "op": "/",
                  "args": [
                   {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                     {
                      "op": "min",
                      "args": [
                       "qtot",
                       {
                        "op": "apply_expression_template",
                        "args": [],
                        "name": "zm_qsat_hPa",
                        "bindings": {
                         "t": "TK",
                         "p": "p"
                        }
                       }
                      ]
                     },
                     "p"
                    ]
                   },
                   {
                    "op": "+",
                    "args": [
                     "eps1",
                     {
                      "op": "min",
                      "args": [
                       "qtot",
                       {
                        "op": "apply_expression_template",
                        "args": [],
                        "name": "zm_qsat_hPa",
                        "bindings": {
                         "t": "TK",
                         "p": "p"
                        }
                       }
                      ]
                     }
                    ]
                   }
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "const",
                "args": [],
                "value": 1000.0,
                "units": "hPa"
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "-",
              "args": [
               "rl",
               {
                "op": "*",
                "args": [
                 {
                  "op": "-",
                  "args": [
                   "cpliq",
                   "cpwv"
                  ]
                 },
                 {
                  "op": "-",
                  "args": [
                   "TK",
                   "tfreez"
                  ]
                 }
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             {
              "op": "min",
              "args": [
               "qtot",
               {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "zm_qsat_hPa",
                "bindings": {
                 "t": "TK",
                 "p": "p"
                }
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           },
           "TK"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "min",
              "args": [
               "qtot",
               {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "zm_qsat_hPa",
                "bindings": {
                 "t": "TK",
                 "p": "p"
                }
               }
              ]
             },
             "rh2o"
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "log",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
               {
                "op": "min",
                "args": [
                 "qtot",
                 {
                  "op": "apply_expression_template",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "zm_qsat_hPa",
                  "bindings": {
                   "t": "TK",
                   "p": "p"
                  }
                 }
                ]
               },
               {
                "op": "apply_expression_template",
                "args": [],
                "name": "zm_qsat_hPa",
                "bindings": {
                 "t": "TK",
                 "p": "p"
                }
               }
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_theta_v_env": {
   "description": "Environmental virtual potential temperature thetavm = t (1000/p)^(rd/cp) (1 + 0.608 q) of closure (zm_convr.F90:2462 above the LCL and 2480 below), with 1000 the pref = 1000 hPa reference pressure and rd/cp the dimensionless R/cp ratio.",
   "params": [
    "t",
    "p",
    "rd",
    "cp",
    "q"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "t",
       {
        "op": "^",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1000.0,
            "units": "hPa"
           },
           "p"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           "rd",
           "cp"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.608,
          "units": "1"
         },
         "q"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_theta_v_parcel_above_lcl": {
   "description": "Parcel virtual potential temperature thetavp = tp (1000/p)^(rd/cp) (1 + 1.608 qstp - q_mx) of the closure above-LCL branch (zm_convr.F90:2457): the parcel water-vapor term is qstp (the saturated parcel value) minus the launch-level q(mx), with 1000 the pref = 1000 hPa reference pressure. q_mx is the launch-level environmental specific humidity q(i, mx(i)).",
   "params": [
    "tp",
    "p",
    "rd",
    "cp",
    "qstp",
    "q_mx"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "tp",
       {
        "op": "^",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1000.0,
            "units": "hPa"
           },
           "p"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           "rd",
           "cp"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "-",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1.608,
            "units": "1"
           },
           "qstp"
          ]
         },
         "q_mx"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_theta_v_parcel_below_lcl": {
   "description": "Parcel virtual potential temperature thetavp = tp (1000/p)^(rd/cp) (1 + 0.608 q_mx) of the closure below-LCL branch (zm_convr.F90:2474): below the LCL the parcel holds only the launch-level water q_mx (no condensate). 1000 is the pref = 1000 hPa reference pressure.",
   "params": [
    "tp",
    "p",
    "rd",
    "cp",
    "q_mx"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "tp",
       {
        "op": "^",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1000.0,
            "units": "hPa"
           },
           "p"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           "rd",
           "cp"
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "const",
        "args": [],
        "value": 1.0,
        "units": "1"
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 0.608,
          "units": "1"
         },
         "q_mx"
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_dqsdtp": {
   "description": "d(qs)/dT of the parcel at the level, dqsdtp = qstp (1 + qstp/eps1) eps1 rl / (rd tp^2) (closure, zm_convr.F90:2458), in 1/K.",
   "params": [
    "qstp",
    "eps1",
    "rl",
    "rd",
    "tp"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "/",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "qstp",
         {
          "op": "+",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "const",
            "args": [],
            "value": 1.0,
            "units": "1"
           },
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             "qstp",
             "eps1"
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         "eps1",
         "rl"
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
       "rd",
       {
        "op": "^",
        "args": [
         "tp",
         2
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_dtpdt": {
   "description": "Parcel temperature response to the subcloud-layer property changes, dtpdt = tp/(1 + rl/cp (dqsdtp - qstp/tp)) (dtbdt/t_mx + rl/cp (dqbdt/tl - q_mx/tl^2 dtldt)) (closure, zm_convr.F90:2460-2462), in K per unit cloud-base mass flux (K/hPa): t_mx and q_mx are the launch-level temperature and specific humidity t(i,mx(i)), q(i,mx(i)), tl the LCL temperature, dtbdt/dqbdt/dtldt the subcloud-layer property rates of the closure.",
   "params": [
    "tp",
    "qstp",
    "dqsdtp",
    "dtbdt",
    "t_mx",
    "dqbdt",
    "tl",
    "q_mx",
    "dtldt",
    "rl",
    "cp"
   ],
   "body": {
    "op": "*",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "/",
      "args": [
       "tp",
       {
        "op": "+",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "const",
          "args": [],
          "value": 1.0,
          "units": "1"
         },
         {
          "op": "*",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             "rl",
             "cp"
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "-",
            "args": [
             "dqsdtp",
             {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
               "qstp",
               "tp"
              ]
             }
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "op": "+",
      "args": [
       {
        "op": "/",
        "args": [
         "dtbdt",
         "t_mx"
        ]
       },
       {
        "op": "*",
        "args": [
         {
          "op": "/",
          "args": [
           "rl",
           "cp"
          ]
         },
         {
          "op": "-",
          "args": [
           {
            "op": "/",
            "args": [
             "dqbdt",
             "tl"
            ]
           },
           {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
             {
              "op": "/",
              "args": [
               "q_mx",
               {
                "op": "^",
                "args": [
                 "tl",
                 2
                ]
               }
              ]
             },
             "dtldt"
            ]
           }
          ]
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     }
    ]
   }
  },
  "zm_dtmdt_jt": {
