  "zm_dboydt_above_lcl": {
   "description": "The CAPE-change integrand above the LCL, dboydt = ((dtpdt/tp + 1/(1 + 1.608 qstp - q_mx) (1.608 dqsdtp dtpdt - dqbdt)) - (dtmdt/t + 0.608/(1 + 0.608 q) dqmdt)) grav thetavp/thetavm (closure, zm_convr.F90:2464-2468): the parcel side uses the full water-vapor term 1.608 qstp - q_mx, the environment side the 0.608 q term; thetavp/thetavm are the branch's virtual potential temperatures. m/(s^2 hPa) per unit cloud-base mass flux.",
   "params": [
